# DevDocs UI (Skeleton v5)

- Use [Skeleton v5](https://www.skeleton.dev/) for all product surfaces under `/app`, login, and settings.
- Do not add parallel UI kits (shadcn-only pages, DaisyUI-as-primary, unstyled forms).
- Prefer Skeleton framework components: Navigation, Dialog, Toast, Tabs, Tags Input, Forms, Card, Table, App Bar.
- Use **v5 APIs only** — not Skeleton v2–v4 doc examples.
- Custom components should compose Skeleton primitives or Skeleton Tailwind tokens.
